<p class="copy">
	Yachts are purpose-built personal transport vessels used by those who are too rich or important to travel by <?php echo sf_lore_link('cutters', 'cutter'); ?>. Typically sleek and slightly ostentatious, yachts are often some of the most advanced vessels in a system, with top-of-the-line engines, state-of-the-art sensors, and layers of redundant defense and life-support systems. Most frequently operated by politicians, the corporate elite, or business moguls, they’re rarely seen without at least a <?php echo sf_lore_link('fighters', 'fighter'); ?> escort.
